OL,3,GNEWSASwinney calls violence against
OL,4,Awomen a 'national emergency' as new
OL,5,Aadvert launched
OL,6,
OL,7,FFirst Minister John Swinney has called
OL,8,Fthe rates of violence against women and
OL,9,Fgirls in Scotland a "national
OL,10,Femergency" as Police Scotland rolls out
OL,11,Fa new campaign to tackle misogyny.
OL,13,FThe force's 'That Guy' campaign, which
OL,14,Fincludes a new television advert, urges
OL,15,Fmen to be positive role models for
OL,16,Fyounger generations who are often
OL,17,Fexposed to toxic attitudes online.
OL,19,FPolice highlighted that more than 200
OL,20,Fcrimes of violence against women and
OL,21,Fgirls are recorded on average every
OL,22,Fday.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
