OL,3,GNEWSASwinney calls violence against
OL,4,Awomen a 'national emergency' as new
OL,5,Aadvert launched
OL,6,
OL,7,FThey said boys are increasingly seeing
OL,8,Fmisogynistic content online including
OL,9,Ffrom so-called "manosphere"
OL,10,Finfluencers, with attitudes towards
OL,11,Fwomen, sex and relationships
OL,12,Fpotentially being shaped from a young
OL,13,Fage.
